#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:5
#: da2fcad757414030b92783748909262e
msgid "Camera Triggering using Seagull MAP-X2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:10
#: 139c538309fb4353abac462722a546d1
msgid "The `Seagull MAP-X2 <https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-map-x2/>`__ is a precision camera shutter trigger and logger. It can be connected to Pixhawk or other ArduPilot compatible autopilot in order to automate camera shutter triggering and log the precise coordinates of each photo for geotagging purposes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:12
#: 1baaa465de8f4ddfbfb80e80bcae340e
msgid "The current list of compatible cameras can be found on `Seagull Cable Finder <https://www.seagulluav.com/map-cable-finder/>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:14
#: 53b3b1b13ac642e6b58c2a84b24ff2c5
msgid "Seagull MAP-X2 utilizes event based logging for extra precision if used with the `Seagull SYNC2 Hot Shoe Adapter <https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-sync2/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:16
#: 5092f78b025148c68a352ef959d41112
msgid "The board supports 4 shutter trigger modes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:18
#: d69e5aee1e2741528d5cff685ebf05a1
msgid "**ACT** (\"AutoCustomTrigger\") : user is able to define required focus time and then trigger"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:19
#: aefdc00cd337469bbad46c87a53cc886
msgid "**PWM** : fully customisable PWM trigger for cameras that utilize PWM triggering"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:20
#: 2790d4ee56b84af28adf1dee25b9cae7
msgid "**SST** : read event signal then trigger"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:21
#: dc0e6fbf39924bc8ad2ee4e501dd8b30
msgid "**Timelapse** : user defined interval triggering"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:23
#: 0f8d011633e54367bce47eb4b9f268fa
msgid "Seagull MAP-X2 also supports **\"Camera ON/OFF\"** - which is exclusive to **Sony MULTI** cameras."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:25
#: dfd4d9bc03ca487eb1995071eaa729e2
msgid "More detailed instructions on how to setup MAP-X2 are provided in the `Seagull MAP-X2 Manual <https://www.seagulluav.com/manuals/Seagull_MAP-X2-Manual.pdf>`__ as well as `Seagull MAP-X2 Support <https://www.seagulluav.com/seagull-map-x2-support/>`__ page."
msgstr ""
